# Dack Fayden's emblem: "Whenever you cast a spell that targets one or more permanents, gain control of those permanents."
# Bot1 reaches the emblem on turn 7 and casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2's Concealing Curtains. With the emblem's ability
# on the stack above the Bolt, Bot2 counters the Bolt. The ability is independent of the spell once triggered: it
# resolves with the permanent it was cast to take (CR 608.2h), so Bot1 controls the Curtains although the Bolt is gone.

